closed','','lakeside-modern-cabin','','','2026-09-15 09:09:00','2026-09-15 01:09:00','','0','http://localhost/estatein/property/lakeside-modern-cabin/','6','property','','0'),('23','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Our experience with Estatein was outstanding. Their team dedication and professionalism made finding our dream home a breeze. Highly recommended!','Exceptional Service!','','publish','closed','closed','','exceptional-service','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/testimonial/exceptional-service/','1','testimonial','','0'),('24','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Estatein provided us with top-notch service. They helped us sell our property quickly and at a great price. We could not be happier with the results.','Efficient and Reliable','','publish','closed','closed','','efficient-and-reliable','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/testimonial/efficient-and-reliable/','2','testimonial','','0'),('25','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','The Estatein team guided us through the entire buying process. Their knowledge and commitment to our needs were impressive. Thank you for your support!','Trusted Advisors','','publish','closed','closed','','trusted-advisors','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/testimonial/trusted-advisors/','3','testimonial','','0'),('26','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','We were first-time buyers and had a lot of questions. Every one of them was answered clearly and without pressure. The process never felt rushed.','Straightforward From Start to Finish','','publish','closed','closed','','straightforward-from-start-to-finish','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/testimonial/straightforward-from-start-to-finish/','4','testimonial','','0'),('27','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Learn how to use our user-friendly search tools to find properties that match your criteria. Filter by location, property type, number of bedrooms and price, then save any listing to revisit later.','How do I search for properties on Estatein?','','publish','closed','closed','','how-do-i-search-for-properties','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/faq/how-do-i-search-for-properties/','1','faq','','0'),('28','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Find out about the necessary documentation for listing your property with us. In most cases we need proof of ownership, photo identification, any existing survey or floor plan, and details of outstanding charges on the property.','What documents do I need to sell my property through Estatein?','','publish','closed','closed','','what-documents-do-i-need-to-sell','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/faq/what-documents-do-i-need-to-sell/','2','faq','','0'),('29','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Discover the different ways you can get in touch with our experienced agents. You can call the office directly, send an enquiry through the contact form, or request a call back at a time that suits you.','How can I contact an Estatein agent?','','publish','closed','closed','','how-can-i-contact-an-agent','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/faq/how-can-i-contact-an-agent/','3','faq','','0'),('30','0','2026-09-14 21:54:41','2026-09-14 13:54:41','Most sales complete within eight to twelve weeks of an offer being accepted, though this varies with the chain and the type of finance involved. Your agent will give you a realistic estimate for your specific situation.','How long does a typical sale take to complete?','','publish','closed','closed','','how-long-does-a-sale-take','','','2026-09-15 09:09:03','2026-09-15 01:09:03','','0','http://localhost/estatein/faq/how-long-does-a-sale-take/','4